    "assistivetext": "This is a drawing depicting a celestial scene with angels and symbolic imagery. In the central panel, a group of seven angels stand side by side with arms raised, surrounded by stars. Below them, an older figure appears commanding, while to his sides are figures kneeling. The surrounding border contains symbolic illustrations, including depictions of the sun and moon, and elements like waves and mountains. The illustration is accompanied by text that enhances the mystical and spiritual tone of the image."
